    "home_faq_rt7qWr": {
      "type": "home-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "text_9TMJph": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Floor coverage and fit</p>",
            "des": "<p><strong>-Will the mats really fit?</strong><br/>Yes, our EVA mats are designed separately for every make, model and version. They cover the whole floor area and protect places ordinary rubber or velour mats never reach.</p><p><strong>-What is a tunnel mat?</strong><br/>EVA mats cover up to 98% of the floor including the centre tunnel, giving the interior maximum protection.</p><p><strong>-Is the heel pad fitted to the driver's mat?</strong><br/>No, the heel pad is supplied separately so its position can be adapted to your preference.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "text_ngHreL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Material properties and durability</p>",
            "des": "<p><strong>-What is EVA material?</strong><br/>It is a 10 mm foam that traps dirt and water on the surface of the mat and stops them getting underneath.</p><p><strong>-What is the difference between a 3D set and a 3D set with edges?</strong><br/>A 3D set with edges also protects the sides of the floor, so it gives even better coverage and a more precise fit.</p><p><strong>-How long do the mats last?</strong><br/>Thanks to the durable EVA material the mats last 5 to 7 years without signs of wear.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "text_YQtmcm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Use and care</p>",
            "des": "<p><strong>-How do I clean EVA mats?</strong><br/>Dirt does not stick to the surface of the mat. Just shake it out, or rinse it with a pressure washer if it is heavily soiled.</p><p><br/><strong>-Are EVA mats suitable for summer and winter?</strong><br/>Yes, they are water-resistant, odourless, temperature-resistant and ideal for year-round use.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        },
        "text_MajL7K": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "category": "",
            "hd": "<p>Ordering and delivery</p>",
            "des": "<p><strong>-What is the delivery time?</strong><br/>We usually fulfil orders within 2 weeks. For special vehicles such as motorboats or tractors it can extend to 4–6 weeks.<br/></p><p><strong>-How is delivery handled?</strong><br/>We send the mats by courier straight to the customer's address. Because of the size of the product we do not send them to parcel lockers. We make sure they arrive in the same condition they were made in — without folding or deformation that could affect the fit.</p>",
            "des_html": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_9TMJph",
        "text_ngHreL",
